Package: ICON
Title: Isoform-Cell-type Classification via Overlapping Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sachini", "Wijewardena", email = "jithma.wijewardena@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Hierarchical Random Forest pipeline for cell type classification
    from single-cell RNA-seq data. ICON uses both isoform and gene count matrices
    and combines predictions from two levels of Random Forest models to improve
    cell type classification accuracy.
